AB  - The integration of Generative AI into educational environments provides opportunities for VR learning in, some current applications often rely on single turn interactions that limit student exploration. To address this, we propose a novel educational framework about seamless 360-degree panoramic image generation with a multi-agent collaborative system. Our approach is based on the agent-assisted iterative co-creation process. We introduce a Tri-Agent architecture, comprising an interactive director agent for panorama-aware local editing, a mentor agent for knowledge-driven pedagogical scaffolding, and a companion agent for empathetic, peer-like support. The user study with across diverse disciplines shows that our framework enhances knowledge gain, skill mastery, and the quality of generated educational scenarios. This research presents a comprehensive, interactive, and supportive ecosystem for AI-empowered immersive education by seamlessly integrating dynamic visualization with structured multi-agent assistance.
