AB  - We present Inkfinity, an AR interaction paradigm bridging stylusbased spatial inking and actionable user intent through multimodal semantics. Using a spatially-tracked stylus, users write on physical surfaces and transform handwriting into interactive smart widgets via simple encircling gestures (e.g., converting “Meeting at 3pm” into a tappable reminder). Beyond digitization, Inkfinity enables contextual spatial queries: users encircle real-world objects to trigger AI-generated insights as AR overlays. By combining fluid stylus input with intelligent semantic understanding, this work demonstrates a seamless workflow for augmenting productivity in everyday environments.
